    "diff": "--- how-to-book-concert-tickets-berlin@1\n+++ proposed\n@@ -6,6 +6,7 @@\n - Start at the venue's own programme or the Berlin events calendar, then follow the official ticket link shown for that event.\n - Eventim is an authorised ticketing agency in Germany; check that the seller named on the event page matches the checkout before paying.\n - Check the venue page for doors, age limits, accessibility and bag rules, which vary by show.\n+- Confirm the venue's accessibility arrangements on its own page before booking.\n \n ## Sources\n - [berlin.de](https://www.berlin.de/events/)",
